<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Life Inside a Nursing Home – Singapore</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Nunito:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Merriweather:ital,wght@0,400;0,700;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --bg:         #f4f7f4;
    --surface:    #ffffff;
    --surface2:   #eef3ee;
    --sage:       #4a7c59;
    --sage-mid:   #6a9e78;
    --sage-light: #d4e8d9;
    --sage-pale:  #eaf3ec;
    --amber:      #c97d2e;
    --amber-pale: #fdf3e3;
    --amber-light:#f5ddb5;
    --ink:        #1e2b1f;
    --ink-soft:   #3d4f3e;
    --ink-muted:  #7a8f7b;
    --border:     #ccdece;
    --radius-sm:  10px;
    --radius-md:  16px;
    --radius-lg:  22px;
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

  body {
    font-family: 'Nunito', sans-serif;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }

  .hero {
    background: var(--surface);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 2.2rem 1.5rem 2rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .hero-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--sage-pale);
    color: var(--sage);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 4px 13px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--sage-light);
  }

  .hero h1 {
    font-family: 'Merriweather', serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 4.5vw, 2rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--ink);
    line-height: 1.35;
    max-width: 560px;
    margin: 0 auto 0.7rem;
  }

  .hero-sub {
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    font-size: 15px;
    max-width: 460px;
    margin: 0 auto 1.4rem;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .btn-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 7px;
    font-family: 'Nunito', sans-serif;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 9px 20px;
    border-radius: 50px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: opacity 0.15s, transform 0.1s;
  }
  .btn:hover { opacity: 0.88; transform: translateY(-1px); }
  .btn-primary { background: var(--sage); color: #ffffff; }
  .btn-outline  { background: transparent; color: var(--sage); border: 1.5px solid var(--sage-light); }

  .intro-wrap {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 1.25rem;
  }

  .intro-banner {
    background: var(--amber-pale);
    border: 1.5px solid var(--amber-light);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: 1.1rem 1.4rem;
    margin: 1.8rem 0;
    font-size: 15px;
    color: #6b3d0e;
    line-height: 1.7;
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .intro-icon { font-size: 22px; line-height: 1; margin-top: 1px; flex-shrink: 0; }

  main {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 1.25rem 4rem;
  }

  .section { margin-bottom: 2rem; }

  .section-pill {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 7px;
    background: var(--sage-pale);
    border: 1px solid var(--sage-light);
    border-radius: 50px;
    padding: 5px 14px 5px 10px;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .section-emoji { font-size: 17px; line-height: 1; }

  .section-title {
    font-family: 'Merriweather', serif;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--sage);
  }

  .card {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: 1.1rem 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .card-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 5px;
  }

  .dot {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--sage-mid);
    margin-top: 7px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .card-title {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--ink);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .card-body {
    font-size: 14.5px;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    line-height: 1.7;
    padding-left: 18px;
  }

  a.ts {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-family: monospace;
    background: var(--sage-pale);
    color: var(--sage);
    border: 1px solid var(--sage-light);
    padding: 1px 8px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    margin-left: 3px;
    text-decoration: none;
    white-space: nowrap;
    font-weight: 700;
    transition: background 0.15s;
  }
  a.ts:hover { background: var(--sage-light); }

  .pull-quote {
    background: var(--surface2);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
    padding: 1.4rem 1.5rem;
  }

  .pull-quote p {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .pull-quote p + p { margin-top: 0.7rem; }

  blockquote {
    font-family: 'Merriweather', serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 15.5px;
    color: var(--sage);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--sage-mid);
    padding: 0.5rem 0 0.5rem 1rem;
    margin: 0.9rem 0;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  footer {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--surface);
    text-align: center;
    padding: 1.5rem 1rem;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .hero { padding: 2.2rem 1rem 2rem; }
    main, .intro-wrap { padding-left: 1rem; padding-right: 1rem; }
    .btn-row { flex-direction: column; align-items: center; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="hero">
  <div class="hero-badge">🏥 Awareness · Singapore Nursing Homes</div>
  <h1>What's life really like inside a nursing home?</h1>
  <p class="hero-sub">Many of us have elderly loved ones — yet few of us truly know what daily life looks like behind those doors. This page shares an eye-opening look at the realities of nursing home living in Singapore, through journalist Anita Kapoor's week-long stay at one.</p>
  <div class="btn-row">
    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PRemfpdpaQU" target="_blank">▶ Watch the Documentary</a>
    <a class="btn btn-outline" href="https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Life+In+A+Nursing+Home+CNA+Insider" target="_blank">◎ Short Recap</a>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="intro-wrap">
  <div class="intro-banner">
    <span class="intro-icon">💡</span>
    <span>Singapore has over 70 nursing homes caring for tens of thousands of elderly residents. Yet most of us have little idea what life inside is really like — until we or someone we love ends up there. CNA journalist Anita Kapoor spent a full week living as a resident to find out. The key moments below are taken from her documentary. Tap any timestamp to jump to that scene.</span>
  </div>
</div>

<main>

  <div class="section">
    <div class="section-pill">
      <span class="section-emoji">🔒</span>
      <span class="section-title">Loss of Freedom &amp; Choice</span>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-head"><div class="dot"></div><div class="card-title">A position of submission</div></div>
      <div class="card-body">Anita describes moving into a nursing home as immediately losing control over one's own life. <a class="ts" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PRemfpdpaQU&t=215s" target="_blank">03:35</a></div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-head"><div class="dot"></div><div class="card-title">Controlled schedules</div></div>
      <div class="card-body">Every part of the day — eating, resting, sleeping — is dictated by staff. Residents are expected to be in bed by 8:00 PM. <a class="ts" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PRemfpdpaQU&t=2288s" target="_blank">38:08</a> <a class="ts" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PRemfpdpaQU&t=748s" target="_blank">12:28</a></div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-head"><div class="dot"></div><div class="card-title">Loss of movement</div></div>
      <div class="card-body">Most residents spend their entire day in a wheelchair or lying in bed. Any attempt to move independently is often met with "Where are you going?" — well-intentioned, but diminishing to one's natural instincts. <a class="ts" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PRemfpdpaQU&t=2293s" target="_blank">38:13</a> <a class="ts" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PRemfpdpaQU&t=2335s" target="_blank">38:55</a></div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-head"><div class="dot"></div><div class="card-title">Dehumanization</div></div>
      <div class="card-body">Anita describes the experience as being "dehumanized" — her entire existence reduced to a bed, a bedside table, and meals. <a class="ts" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PRemfpdpaQU&t=164s" target="_blank">02:44</a> <a class="ts" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PRemfpdpaQU&t=378s" target="_blank">06:18</a></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <div class="section-pill">
      <span class="section-emoji">🏠</span>
      <span class="section-title">Living Conditions &amp; Environment</span>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-head"><div class="dot"></div><div class="card-title">Ward living — too close for comfort</div></div>
      <div class="card-body">Anita stays in a six-bedded ward, describing it as "too much human body and heat" — difficult to endure for extended periods. <a class="ts" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PRemfpdpaQU&t=3880s" target="_blank">01:04:40</a> <a class="ts" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PRemfpdpaQU&t=3904s" target="_blank">01:05:04</a></div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-head"><div class="dot"></div><div class="card-title">Dementia ward — dim and enclosed</div></div>
      <div class="card-body">The high-dependency dementia ward is darker and more enclosed. Anita notes a lack of positive lighting, which she believes contributes to exhaustion and depression. <a class="ts" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PRemfpdpaQU&t=1328s" target="_blank">22:08</a> <a class="ts" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PRemfpdpaQU&t=1355s" target="_blank">22:35</a></div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-head"><div class="dot"></div><div class="card-title">Overwhelming sensory environment</div></div>
      <div class="card-body">The space is filled with constant noise and "brutal" sensory experiences — the smell of waste, rows of beds, and little relief from stimulation. <a class="ts" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PRemfpdpaQU&t=1051s" target="_blank">17:31</a></div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-head"><div class="dot"></div><div class="card-title">"Functional food" — nutrition without joy</div></div>
      <div class="card-body">Meals are packet-based slop — Anita describes the texture as "thick saliva." There is no taste, no smell, no pleasure in eating. <a class="ts" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PRemfpdpaQU&t=3734s" target="_blank">01:02:14</a> <a class="ts" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PRemfpdpaQU&t=2066s" target="_blank">34:26</a></div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-head"><div class="dot"></div><div class="card-title">Institutional, not home</div></div>
      <div class="card-body">Anita states that 70–80% of the environment has "nothing homely about it" — designed for functionality, not for living. <a class="ts" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PRemfpdpaQU&t=1302s" target="_blank">21:42</a> <a class="ts" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PRemfpdpaQU&t=3910s" target="_blank">01:05:10</a></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <div class="section-pill">
      <span class="section-emoji">💭</span>
      <span class="section-title">Reflections on Aged Care</span>
    </div>

    <div class="pull-quote">
      <p>Anita concludes that the current system prioritises efficiency and "functionality" over the humanity of residents. Feeding and medication are the focus — quality of life is an afterthought.</p>
      <blockquote>"They are people — with stories, meaning, and a need for purpose."</blockquote>
      <p>She advocates for a fundamental shift: from treating the elderly as <em>patients</em> to recognising them as <em>people</em>. <a class="ts" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PRemfpdpaQU&t=3843s" target="_blank">01:04:03</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>

</main>

<footer>
  Summary based on Anita Kapoor's documentary "Nursing Home Immersion: A Week Inside" &mdash; CNA Insider &middot; Shared for awareness
</footer>

</body>
</html>
